# Functions with new syntax

Define greet:
    print "Hello, World!".
End definition.

Call greet.

Define square with parameter x:
    Return x * x.
End definition.

Set num to 7.
Set squared to Call square with num.
print squared.

Define add with parameters a, b:
    Return a + b.
End definition.

Set sum to Call add with 10, 20.
print sum.

# Nested function calls (need parentheses for complex expressions)
Set nested to Call add with 5, (Call square with 3).
print nested.
